  "notes": "Interim 100-card mono-green Commander deck for the Foundations Tramplesaurus Rex precon (official list unreleased; Ruling M3-P). Commanded by Ghalta, Primal Hunger (12/12 trample). KNOWN ENGINE LIMITATION, measured not assumed: the build does not read a cost-reduction static the card carries on itself — rules/statics.go's activeStatics only collects S: lines from battlefield permanents, and parseAmount on an Amount$ X SVar defaults to 1 — so Ghalta costs a flat 12 in every game under this engine; see the m38 report. The deck is therefore built as honest big-green that CAN reach twelve mana: 37 lands (32 Forest plus a land-search utility suite), seven mana rocks, seven ramp sorceries (Rampant Growth through Skyshroud Claim), a full dork battery (Llanowar Elves family plus Priest of Titania, Elvish Archdruid, Sakura-Tribe Elder, Wood Elves), and high-power beaters (Steel Leaf Champion, Leatherback Baloth, Colossal Dreadmaw, Ancient Brontodon, Pelakka Wurm) so it pressures and survives while the mana comes together; Craterhoof Behemoth and Overrun finish. Colour identity is exactly green: every non-Forest land and artifact is colourless-identity, and no card carries a coloured symbol outside green.",
